  username: string;
  age: number;
  email: string;
}
```

This interface is pretty simple and lacks some important details like contact info or interests. Adding validation or extra fields would just overcomplicate things.

```typescript
interface UserProfile {
    username: string;
    email: string;
    password: string;
}
```

Passwords can be simple strings in user profile interfaces, as more complex handling can decrease usability when saving or updating profiles.
